{"ref":"BDB, אֲפֵלָה","hw":"אֲפֵלָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפֵלָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. darkness, gloominess, calamity</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:22\" href=\"/Exodus.10.22\">Ex 10:22</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפֵלָתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.10\">Is 58:10</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפֵלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.9\">Is 59:9</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>darkness</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.29\">Dt 28:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.9\">Pr 7:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁוֹן לַיְלָה</span>); of supernatural darkness in Egypt <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:22\" href=\"/Exodus.10.22\">Ex 10:22</a>; of day of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:20\" href=\"/Amos.5.20\">Am 5:20</a> sub <span dir=\"rtl\">אָפֵל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:2\" href=\"/Joel.2.2\">Jo 2:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:15\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.15\">Zp 1:15</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חשׁך</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ענן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ערפל</span>) sim. of wickedness <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.12\">Je 23:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.19\">Pr 4:19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  fig. of <em>calamity</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.22\">Is 8:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲשֵׁכָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.10\">58:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חשׁך</span>, opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">צהרים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.9\">59:9</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>, opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">נגהות</span>).","next":"BDB, אָפִיל","prev":"BDB, אָפֵל"}